{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 62504, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 45934, "uid": 57, "type": 4, "title": "点火系统介绍(赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋)", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1606963158, "updated_at": 1607131750, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1664239336, "last_at": 1668943309, "comment_count": 3, "status": 1, "summary": "各位魔王候补生大家好，在此向各位介绍2020年12月3号更新后新增的点火系统以及赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋。是否为二级目录：删除-本次更新中新增可让Child获得成长的点火系统-透过点火系统Child可突破极", "thumb": "https://bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/32f702/5_bbfUd018bnga1wjluo3jihd_arpk7f.png?type=w660,https://bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/32f7j7/3_jbfUd018bngcjsgzuhdx3cd_o8kbxm.png?type=w660,https://bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/32f78g/2_8bfUd018bng1g60uj6y5lyuv_ryya4a.png?type=w660", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 10, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 30130, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 62504, "content": "<span><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">各位魔王候补生大家好，在此向各位介绍2020年12月3号更新后新增的点火系统以及赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋。<br><br><span></span></span></p><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"点火系统\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div></span><br>- 本次更新中新增可让Child获得成长的点火系统<br>- 透过点火系统Child可突破极限，获得全新阶段的成长<br>- Child可在点火系统中提升能力值和技能以及增幅能力值<br>- 您可在夜世界的「赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋」中消耗一定的核心材料和Child来制作点火核心<br> <br>▶ 什么是赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋?<br>靠着恶魔「洛基」提供的驱魔师秘笈「卡巴拉」和恶魔「柳道士」提供的黄泉之花。锻造达人恶魔「赫菲斯托斯」研究了驱魔师独特的轮回系统后，终于成功打造出能够强化Child的点火核心方法。打造点火核心需要准备核心材料和Child，将两者投入熔炉里才能制成。将锻造完成的核心材料装备在Child上，就能解放Child内心的邪恶之树，进而提升他们的能力。<br> <br><span><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div></span><br>夜世界中新增赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋<br>* 帐号等级满LV.7即可进入夜世界<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963570_j_0bbUd018bngde7aibyrr6ob_qocct6.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 3\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>您可在赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋中制作点火核心。将制作的点火核心装备在符合条件的Child身上，即可启用点火系统，进一步提升他们的能力。<br>您也可在赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋中查看更多的说明。<br> <br><span><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"点火核心制作方法\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div></span><br>- 点击制作点火核心<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963570_0_fbcUd018bngy19nrzdynbmo_5ib6sv.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 5\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 您可在此制作4种不同的点火核心<br>- 分别为增幅攻击力、增幅防御力、增幅敏捷度、增幅暴击等4种。<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963570_1_ibcUd018bng1j2kpr1tud9x4_8xe0ar.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 7\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 制作点火核心时，需要该类型的核心材料 99个、原生5★Child以及金币 150,000个<br>※ 无法使用进化和强化型Child作为材料<br>※ 制作核心时使用的Child没有属性限制<br>※ 用来制作材料的Child将会消失、并且无法还原<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963570_4_0bcUd018bngynf0ibow0unx_hufnnu.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 9\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 核心材料不足99个时，可以额外购买<br>- 1个核心材料价格为50水晶<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963571_5_cbcUd018bng9qauwozfbsbj_790kfz.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 11\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 打造的点火核心可获得3种能力值<br>- 第一个能力值将根据打造的核心种类固定分为增幅攻击力、增幅防御力、增幅敏捷度和增幅暴击<br>- 第二、第三个能力值将随机赋予<br>ex) 成功打造的增幅攻击力点火核心:<br>第一个能力值固定为增幅攻击力，第二和第三个能力值则会出现增幅攻击力以外的随机能力值<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963571_7_4bcUd018bng1hm51x2q8y0i2_a0jj2u.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 13\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>※ 详细的机率请参考下面的点火核心制作能力值机率表<br>- 制作的点火核心可在点火仓库和道具物品栏中确认<br> <br>1) 点火仓库<p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963571_8_abcUd018bng1avf3ezjq6aur_a7zx7w.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 15\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963571_e_9bcUd018bng14hnubelltgi8_ws110e.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 16\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br>2) 道具物品栏<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963571_d_abcUd018bng1o01cgp06vfnx_apet9x.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 18\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>点火核心和核心材料可在物品栏中售出<br>- 点火核心售出价格为红石7个<br>- 核心材料售出价格为1,000金币<br> <br><span></span></span></p><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"点火核心装备方法\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br>- 点火核心在Child达6★、等级 60、觉醒 100%时方可装备<br>- 可使用点火的Child将新增点火图示<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963571_h_0bcUd018bng1b82ngqh09jo4_k2x8j0.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 20\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 装备点火核心可由此进入，或从夜世界&gt;赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋中进入<br>- 在下图中的起始栏位中装备点火核心后即可解放邪恶之树<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963572_i_cbcUd018bnghmzsa1k7ai7s_k2w99b.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 22\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 点选点火核心即可装备核心<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963572_d_8bdUd018bng18fhkw7vt31sj_5e1fwm.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 24\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 装备点火核心来解放邪恶之树<br>※ 使用的点火核心将不会返还<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963572_e_fbdUd018bng8bd4pl6xxvpy_gpq8ee.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 26\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 当Child的邪恶之树如下图解放时，点火等级和增幅能力值将会上升<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963572_g_abdUd018bng135sxfcg2gfkw_h9giq1.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 28\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 当邪恶之树解放后，相关栏位将会启用(如下图)<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963573_h_abdUd018bng14y3mikao736g_vr4ntc.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 30\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 根据起始栏位中装备的点火核心来决定邪恶之树的核心能力值<br>- 不同的点火核心中核心能力值将不相同<br>EX) 根据起始栏位中装备的核心，获得提升的能力值为增幅攻击力、HP、暴击<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963573_7_ibgUd018bng1db4uwilvv71b_fzlx0w.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 32\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963573_7_hbgUd018bng15uuzcm3rwbu0_ntp0ho.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 33\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">- 未解锁的部分可以依序启用。<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963573_f_abeUd018bng18abrjr7ntykl_z3kb18.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 35\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 启用各栏位时需要的材料，根据Child原生★数有所不同<br>- 作为材料使用的Child需与点火中的Child原生★数相同更高，或是相同属性<br>- 需要的缟玛瑙素材在不同阶段升级时，将依序增加<br>- 点火等级分为Lv.1~Lv.12。<br>- 详细内容可参考下图，点击各栏位可确认说明。<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963573_j_ibeUd018bngelp2olx6wdms_7n9rxo.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 37\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 点火技能上升时，可如下图查看技能提升的变化。<br>※每位Child的技能上升变化皆有所不同，详细内容请在游戏内确认。<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963573_1_0bfUd018bngvu86g2w60fwx_7gwx2h.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 39\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963574_2_8bfUd018bng1g60uj6y5lyuv_ryya4a.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 40\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">- 邪恶之树如下图分为主轴和分支。<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963574_3_jbfUd018bngcjsgzuhdx3cd_o8kbxm.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 42\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 邪恶之树主轴栏位可提升增幅能力值和强化技能，并决定Child点火的识别色<br>- 获得的增幅能力值将由装备在起始栏位之点火核心所决定。<br>- 每个Child获得的强化技能皆为专属技能。<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963574_5_bbfUd018bnga1wjluo3jihd_arpk7f.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 44\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 邪恶之树分支的栏位将根据装备在起始栏位的点火核心决定第二、第三项能力值强化度。<br>- 获得的能力值将由装备在起始栏位的点火核心来决定<br> <br><span></span></span></p><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"点火核心更换方法\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br>- 您可以在赫菲斯托斯的锻造屋中更换起始点火核心。<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/2020/1606963575_6_ibfUd018bng1wd76jq3dqgm0_2665e8.png\" alt=\"命運之子: 公告事項 - ?點火系統介紹(赫菲斯托斯的鍛造屋) image 46\" style=\"border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></span><br>- 更换核心后，已启用的栏位将会保持开放。更换的核心能力值和点火等级将会立刻变更。<br>- 更换核心时，已装备的核心将会损毁且不会退还，请谨慎使用。<br><span><img data-v-9daed42e=\"\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/d